From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:19:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Coordinate bounded durable reorg steps and exact source
 recovery

Integration review note (2026-10-15; original source commit had no body):
Execute bounded reorg steps through full block validation, retaining source
bodies for exact restoration. Enforce pre-copy quotas and reserve diagnostic
space so operational fallback fits the prepared journal creation cap.

